c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0160","start":160,"end":161,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"劉粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0188","start":188,"end":189,"surface":"詵","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","raw_start":5238,"raw_end":5441,"raw_line":64},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p011","text":"陳敏之亂，吳士多為其所逼。顧榮先受敏官，而潛謀圖之。譚不悟榮旨，露檄遠近，極言其非，由此為榮所怨。又在郡政嚴，而與上司多忤。揚州刺史劉陶素與譚不善，因法收譚，下壽陽獄。鎮東將軍周馥與譚素相親善，理而出之。及甘卓討馥，百姓奔散，馥謂譚已去，遣人視之，而更移近馥。馥歎曰：「吾嘗謂華令思是臧子源之疇，今果效矣。」甘卓嘗為東海王越所捕，下令敢有匿者誅之，卓投譚而免。及此役也，卓遣人求之曰：「華侯安在？吾甘揚威使也。」譚答不知，遺絹二匹以遣之。使反，告卓。卓曰：「此華侯也。」復求之，譚已亡矣。後為紀瞻所薦，而為顧榮所止遏，遂數年不得調。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":78,"last_line":78,"raw_start":7653,"raw_end":7919,"raw_character_offsets":[7653,7654,7655,7656,7657,7658,7659,7660,7661,7662,7663,7664,7665,7666,7667,7668,7669,7670,7671,7672,7673,7674,7675,7676,7677,7678,7679,7680,7681,7682,7683,7684,7685,7686,7687,7688,7689,7690,7691,7692,7693,7694,7695,7696,7697,7698,7699,7700,7701,7702,7703,7704,7705,7706,7707,7708,7709,7710,7711,7712,7713,7714,7715,7716,7717,7718,7719,7720,7721,7722,7723,7724,7725,7726,7727,7728,7729,7730,7731,7732,7733,7734,7735,7736,7737,7738,7739,7740,7741,7742,7743,7744,7745,7746,7747,7748,7749,7750,7751,7752,7753,7754,7755,7756,7757,7758,7759,7760,7761,7762,7763,7764,7765,7766,7767,7768,7769,7770,7771,7772,7773,7774,7775,7776,7777,7778,7779,7780,7781,7782,7783,7784,7785,7786,7787,7788,7789,7790,7791,7792,7793,7794,7795,7796,7797,7798,7799,7800,7801,7802,7803,7804,7805,7806,7807,7808,7809,7810,7811,7812,7813,7814,7815,7816,7817,7818,7819,7820,7821,7822,7823,7824,7825,7826,7827,7828,7829,7830,7831,7832,7833,7834,7835,7836,7837,7838,7839,7840,7841,7842,7843,7844,7845,7846,7847,7848,7849,7850,7851,7852,7853,7854,7855,7856,7857,7858,7859,7860,7861,7862,7863,7864,7865,7866,7867,7868,7869,7870,7871,7872,7873,7874,7875,7876,7877,7878,7879,7880,7881,7882,7883,7884,7885,7886,7887,7888,7889,7890,7891,7892,7893,7894,7895,7896,7897,7898,7899,7900,7901,7902,7903,7904,7905,7906,7907,7908,7909,7910,7911,7912,7913,7914,7915,7916,7917,7918],"revision_id":2604575},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p011:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"陳敏","kind":"person","person_id":"kok_m7n_tux","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p011:m0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"顧榮","kind":"person","person_id":"wtz_smr_dwz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-052-hua-tan:p011:m0017","s